<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>again and again</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">WIMY</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">again and again</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3tsECONbCznHQSd2JR4VQN</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.850" end="00:20.690">Just stay, too much on my plate</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.690" end="00:28.690">Do you know, how badly I need you? I’m here all alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.940" end="00:34.820">My brain can't put you away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.820" end="00:42.820">Don’t you know how badly I want you to get out of my head?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.820" end="00:47.330">What have I said?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.330" end="00:51.770">You’re gone again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.770" end="00:55.940">Would you still call me a friend?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.940" end="00:59.570">I keep running back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.570" end="01:05.690">You’ll break me again and again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.690" end="01:10.050">I would still love to pretend</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.050" end="01:18.050">That someday you’ll learn to love me again and again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.670" end="01:26.670" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.510" end="01:41.950">Can you feel me fading slowly?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.950" end="01:49.010">I don’t know who I am anymore</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.010" end="01:52.530">Can you hear me?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.530" end="01:55.290">You’re not sorry (Sorry I miss)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.290" end="02:02.220">Baby, I miss holding you in my bed (In my bed)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.220" end="02:05.090">What have I said?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.090" end="02:09.570">You’re gone again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.570" end="02:13.410">Would you still call me a friend? (Would you still call me a friend?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.410" end="02:17.210">I keep running back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.210" end="02:23.490">You’ll break me again and again (And again)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.490" end="02:27.740">I would still love to pretend (Love to pretend)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.740" end="02:35.740">That somеday you’ll learn to love me again and again (Lovе me and again)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.650" end="02:40.650" /></div></body></tt>